export type LiveEvent={id:number;text:string};export type Listener=(event:LiveEvent)=>void;export type Feed={subscribe:(listener:Listener)=>()=>void;emit:(event:LiveEvent)=>void;publish:(text:string)=>void;listenerCount:()=>number};
export function createFeed():Feed{const listeners=new Set<Listener>();let nextId=1;const emit=(event:LiveEvent)=>{for(const listener of [...listeners])listener(event);};return {subscribe(listener){listeners.add(listener);return ()=>{listeners.delete(listener);};},emit,publish(text){if(!Number.isSafeInteger(nextId))throw RangeError("ID zdarzenia");emit({id:nextId++,text});},listenerCount:()=>listeners.size};}
